Cross-Exchange Futures Arbitrage System (Binance & Bitget)

Project Overview

This project is a fully automated Python-based cross-exchange futures arbitrage trading system. It continuously monitors the price of the same cryptocurrency futures contract on Binance Futures and Bitget Futures. Whenever it detects a significant price difference between the two exchanges, it automatically opens opposite positions on each exchange to profit from the expected price convergence while minimizing overall market risk. 


---

Objective

The primary objective of this project is to automate the process of detecting and executing arbitrage opportunities between cryptocurrency futures exchanges. Instead of relying on manual monitoring, the bot performs the entire workflow automatically, including market analysis, order execution, risk management, and trade monitoring. 


